the landlord\'s hand\n2. I still hold the unbeatable RedJoker as my final card\n3. If everyone passes on ♣Q, I win immediately\n4. If beaten, I can guarantee victory with RedJoker on the next turn\n5. Playing RedJoker first would waste its unbeatable power and leave me vulnerable with ♣Q\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♣Q"]}'}
